---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = '28 May 2026';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy | AdriaIntel"
	description="How AdriaIntel handles personal data, cookies, and analytics on this website."
	pathname="/privacy"
>
	<main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
		<h1 class="font-headline text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-primary md:text-4xl">
			Privacy Policy
		</h1>
		<p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

		<div class="prose-adria mt-12 space-y-10 font-body text-on-surface">
			<section>
				<h2 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-primary">Who we are</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
					AdriaIntel (“we”, “us”) operates this website at adriaintel.com to share maritime
					intelligence and related content. For privacy questions, use our
					<a class="text-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-primary-container" href="/contact"
						>contact page</a
					>.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-primary">What we collect</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
					We do not operate a customer database or sell personal data.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
					<strong class="text-on-surface">Contact form</strong> — When you submit our
					<a class="text-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-primary-container" href="/contact"
						>contact form</a
					>, we receive the details you provide (such as your name, email address, and message). We
					do not store those submissions in a database on our own servers. They are sent through a
					third-party API or email (SMTP) service so we can read and reply to your enquiry. That
					provider processes the data on our behalf only to deliver the message to us.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
					If you email us directly outside the form, we use your message only to respond.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section id="cookies">
				<h2 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-primary">Cookies and analytics</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
					<strong class="text-on-surface">Strictly necessary cookies</strong> remember your cookie
					choices (for example, whether you accepted analytics). These are required for the consent
					banner to work.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
					<strong class="text-on-surface">Analytics cookies (optional)</strong> — only if you opt in
					— we use Google Analytics 4 to understand aggregated website usage (such as pages viewed,
					general region, browser, and device type). Google may set cookies such as <code
						class="rounded bg-surface-container px-1 text-sm">_ga</code
					> and process data as a processor under their terms. You can withdraw consent anytime via
					<button
						type="button"
						data-open-cookie-settings
						class="cursor-pointer text-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-primary-container"
						>Cookie settings</button
					> in the footer.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
					We do not load Google Analytics until you accept the Analytics category. We do not use
					advertising or marketing cookies on this site.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-primary">Google Search Console</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
					We use Google Search Console to monitor how our site appears in search results. This
					service does not place analytics cookies on your browser when you visit our pages; data is
					provided to us in Google’s tools.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-primary">Legal basis (EEA visitors)</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
					For contact enquiries we rely on our legitimate interest in responding to your message, or
					on steps taken at your request before entering a contract, depending on the nature of your
					enquiry. For analytics cookies we rely on your consent. Necessary cookies are used based on
					our legitimate interest in operating the site and recording your preferences.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-primary">Your rights</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
					Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or restrict
					processing of personal data, and to object or withdraw consent. Contact us via the
					<a class="text-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-primary-container" href="/contact"
						>contact page</a
					>. You may also lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-primary">Changes</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
					We may update this policy from time to time. The “Last updated” date at the top will
					change when we do.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
